    "number": 94,
    "summary": "1–9, The Lord gives a commandment relative to the erection of a house for the work of the Presidency; 10–12, A printing house is to be built; 13–17, Certain inheritances are assigned.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given through Joseph Smith the Prophet, at Kirtland, Ohio, August 2, 1833, outlining the layout of Kirtland, a stake of Zion, and appointing Hyrum Smith, Reynolds Cahoon, and Jared Carter as a Church building committee."
      }
    ],
